{"id":"HAD-1691","recordType":"athar","language":"de","narratorLine":"al-Ḥasan al-Baṣrī رحمه الله sagte:","speakerLabel":"Er sagte:","textMarkdown":"Der Gläubige bleibt in Sorge um sich selbst, bis er Allah **trifft**.","source":"Ibn Abī ad-Dunyā, Muḥāsabat an-Nafs","grade":"Salaf-Aussage","verificationNote":"100er-Schritt 1651–1750; 20er-Salaf-Unterblock."}